    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Coming Soon! Tower Court brings a fresh perspective to Balla’s housing market. This architecturally designed boutique development offers a carefully considered mix of 3 and 4 bedroom homes, all built with enduring quality and premium finishes. Each home is a traditional block-built construction with the benefits of modern building methods, such as advanced insulation and energy efficient heating. These A rated new homes also feature private gardens and sustainable features that deliver peace of mind and future-proof living.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Balla’s most desirable locations, Tower Court is an exclusive new development of just 12 generously proportioned, high-quality homes, ideally positioned within a peaceful cul-de-sac setting just off The Square in Balla, Co. Mayo. Combining contemporary design with an enviable village-centre location, the development offers an exceptional opportunity for discerning purchasers seeking modern family living within easy reach of all local amenities.\r\n\r\nAt Tower Court, first impressions truly last, with thoughtfully designed exteriors that reflect the quality and style found throughout each home.\r\nInternally this attention to detail continues evident from the carefully planned layout to the immaculate interior finish. Every detail has been carefully considered with the day-to-day comfort of the discerning purchaser in mind.\r\n\r\nEligible purchasers may avail of the Government’s Help to Buy (HTB) incentive scheme.\r\n\r\nFor further information please contact us today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Architecturally designed boutique development of 3 and 4 bedroom homes\r\n-An exclusive development of just 12 beautifully designed, high-quality homes, offering an exceptional standard of modern living\r\n-Superbly located midway between the thriving towns of Claremorris and Castlebar, offering excellent connectivity and convenience\r\n-Superbly positioned within easy walking distance of a wealth of amenities, services and recreational facilities\r\n-Off street parking for 2 cars\r\n-Generous rear gardens with private patio areas, ideal for outdoor living and entertaining\r\n-Extensive open recreational green spaces, perfectly suited to discerning families seeking a quality residential environment.gh speed broadband"
      },
